.Dd November 16, 2026
.Dt NVMF_HOST 4D
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm nvmf_host
.Nd NVMe over Fabrics host driver
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
driver is the host side of NVMe over Fabrics over TCP.
It uses the
.Xr blkdev 4D
framework to present each namespace of a remote NVM subsystem as a
disk.
.Pp
The driver does not connect to a subsystem by itself.
The
.Xr nvmf-connect 8
utility opens the connections and passes them to the driver.
The driver does not re-establish a connection that is lost.
.Pp
The driver supports one connected subsystem at a time.
.Pp
The target is not authenticated and connections are not encrypted.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Pa
.It Pa /kernel/drv/amd64/nvmf_host
Device driver (x86)
.It Pa /kernel/drv/nvmf_host.conf
Driver configuration file
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr blkdev 4D ,
.Xr nvmf-connect 8
